          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu waniamba, “Hala mwalawe uandike maneno higa na maandishi ga kawaida, Maheri-Shalali-Hashi-Bazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maheri-Shalali-Hashi-Bazi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "manage ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "piga-gafula-uhale-haraka.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu ndamuambira Uriya na Zakariya mwana wa Jeberekiya akale mashaidi a hiro dzambo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku zanjina nákala na mkpwazangu, ambaye ni nabii wa chichetu, naye achigbwira mimba na achivyala mwana mlume. Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Dzinare muihe Maheri-Shalali-Hashi-Bazi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana hiye mwana kabila amanye kuamba ‘mayo’ au ‘baba,’ mfalume wa Ashuru andavamia na kuhala zewe mali ya Damasikasi na ya Samariya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami tsona achiamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami na achisisitiza kukala nisiige tabiya za hinya atu. Iye waniamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
